    "Id": "mechdef_kingfisher_KNF-A",
    "Name": "Kingfisher A",
    "Details": "One of the earliest second generation OmniMech designs, the Kingfisher debuted in 2887 and is reputed to have influenced all subsequent Clan Assault OmniMech designs. A 90-ton mech powered by a 360-rated Fusion Engine, the Kingfisher has 24 tons of podspace provided by a combination of Ferro-Fibrous armor and an Endo Steel skeleton. The Kingfisher A is armed with an LB-10X and an ER PPC. At closer ranges, the A can bring to bear an SRM-6, an ER Small Laser, an ER Medium laser and a Medium Pulse Laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_kingfisher"
  },
